# Training corpus + models — too large to version, regenerable from scripts.
# NOTE: leading slash is REQUIRED to anchor these to the repo root.
# Without it, e.g. `models/` would ALSO match `lib/models/` (Session 63
# incident: v1.20.0+115 CI failed with "Error when reading
# 'lib/models/study_set.dart': No such file" because the unanchored
# `models/` was excluding the whole StudySet model directory).
/corpus/
/training_data/
/models/

